an animal disease\nintersection_of: MONDO:0700097 MONDO:7770010 ! cross-species analog disease of primarily extrinsic mechanism\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/10127\" xsd:anyURI\n\n[Term]\nid: MONDO:7770017\nname: disease by molecular mechanism, non-human animal\ndef: \"Disease by molecular mechanism that occurs in non-human animals.\" [MONDO:patterns/nonhuman_disease]\ncomment: This term is intended solely for classification purposes and should not be used for direct data annotation.\nis_a: MONDO:0005583 ! non-human animal disease\nintersection_of: MONDO:0005583 ! non-human animal disease\nintersection_of: MONDO:0700097 MONDO:7770011 ! cross-species analog disease by molecular mechanism\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/10127\" xsd:anyURI\n\n","exit":0,"description":"List existing new term identifiers","truncated":false},"title":"List existing new term identifiers","time":{"start":1778977772928,"end":1778977772935}},"id":"prt_e335694e5001amHYMjPf8PI4CR","sessionID":"ses_1cca9bad2ffenH7vFncSqQKVjg","messageID":"msg_e33566c6c001wgn0eh66suVbMX"}}
