  [About Us](https://www.bioontology.org/about-us/)\n-   [Mission & Vision](https://www.bioontology.org/about-us/#mission)\n-   [Team](https://www.bioontology.org/about-us/#team)\n-   [Projects](/projects)\n\n###### CONNECT\n\n-   [](https://www.facebook.com/National-Center-for-Biomedical-Ontology-127444774011153/)\n-   [](https://twitter.com/bioontology)\n-   [](https://github.com/ncbo)\n\nThe **National Center for Biomedical Ontology** was founded as one of the National Centers for Biomedical Computing, supported by the National Human Genome Research Institute, the National Heart Lung Blood Institute, and the NIH Common Fund under grant U54-HG004028. The resource is now supported in part by grant 5U24GM143402 from the National Institute of General Medical Sciences.\n\nBioPortal is free and open to all users, with no login required.\n\nPowered by [AllegroGraph](https://franz.com/agraph/).\n\nCopyright © 2005‑2026, The Board of Trustees of Leland Stanford Junior University. All rights reserved.\n\n-   [Cite Us](https://www.bioontology.org/about-us/#cite-bioportal)\n\n-   [Privacy Policy](https://www.bioontology.org/privacy/)\n\n-   [Terms of Use](https://www.bioontology.org/terms/)\n\n-   [Use of Cookies](https://www.bioontology.org/terms/#use-of-cookies)","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"https://bioregistry.io/snomedct:444100007 (text/html; charset=utf-8)","time":{"start":1778977782470,"end":1778977786798}},"id":"prt_e3356babf001NxLEV9ekZk8105","sessionID":"ses_1cca9bad2ffenH7vFncSqQKVjg","messageID":"msg_e3356a37b001Bg8eBfiYL7os14"}}
